test('4663/4与5全部六实例真实等级成功边界免弱与用招PP',()=>{for(const x of [...pick(4),...pick(5)]){const s=make(x),target=x.id===4?0:1,k=H.keys[x.params[0]],n=x.params[2];turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[target].stages[k],n);const cap=make(x);cap.fighters[target].stages[k]=n>0?6:-6;turn(cap);assert.equal(cap.fighters[target].stages[k],n>0?6:-6);if(n<0){const immune=make(x);timer(immune,target,'免弱');turn(immune);assert.equal(immune.fighters[target].stages[k],0);}assert.equal(s.fighters[0].pp[key(x.moveId)],H.source.moves.find(m=>m.id===x.moveId).pp-1);}});
test('4663/12三概率实例真实烧伤成功失败与免异常消费',()=>{for(const x of pick(12)){let ok=false,no=false;for(let seed=0;seed<50&&(!ok||!no);seed++){const s=make(x,{seed});turn(s);if(s.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤'])ok=true;else no=true;assert.ok(sum(s)>0);}assert.ok(ok&&no);const immune=make(x);timer(immune,1,'免异常');turn(immune);assert.equal(immune.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤'],undefined);}});
test('4663/31真实10646两或三段每段HP并只消费一次PP',()=>{const counts=new Set();for(let seed=0;seed<20;seed++){const s=make(e(31),{seed});turn(s);const ds=s.damageEvents.filter(x=>x.round===1&&x.type==='attack'&&x.targetSide===1);counts.add(ds.length);assert.ok(ds.every(x=>x.settledDamage>0));assert.equal(s.fighters[0].pp[key(10646)],29);}assert.deepEqual([...counts].sort(),[2,3]);});
test('4663/879两实例消回合后回血至上限，无对象免断禁疗均不回复',()=>{for(const x of pick(879)){const s=make(x,{hp:1000});timer(s,1,'免异常');turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].hp,9000);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].effects['免异常'],undefined);const no=turn(make(x,{hp:1000}));assert.equal(no.fighters[0].hp,1000);const lock=make(x,{hp:1000});timer(lock,1,'免异常');timer(lock,1,'protect');turn(lock);assert.equal(lock.fighters[0].hp,1000);const ban=make(x,{hp:1000});timer(ban,1,'免异常');timer(ban,0,'技能禁疗');turn(ban);assert.equal(ban.fighters[0].hp,1000);}});
test('4663/1048两实例异常红伤加100%，正常对照与完全免攻',()=>{for(const x of pick(1048)){const normal=turn(make(x)),s=make(x);s.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;turn(s);assert.ok(sum(s)>=sum(normal)*1.9);const no=make(x);no.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;timer(no,1,'攻击伤害免疫');turn(no);assert.equal(sum(no),0);}});
test('4663/983未击败全强+1和六项封顶，实际击败不加',()=>{const s=turn(make(e(983)));assert.deepEqual(H.keys.map(k=>s.fighters[0].stages[k]),[1,1,1,1,1,1]);const cap=make(e(983));for(const k of H.keys)cap.fighters[0].stages[k]=6;turn(cap);assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>cap.fighters[0].stages[k]===6));const ko=make(e(983),{targetHp:1});turn(ko);assert.equal(ko.fighters[1].hp,0);assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>ko.fighters[0].stages[k]===0));});
test('4663/3解除自身负阶保留正阶，无负阶和锁弱',()=>{const s=make(e(3));s.fighters[0].stages.atk=-6;s.fighters[0].stages.def=2;turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.atk,0);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.def,2);const no=turn(make(e(3)));assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>no.fighters[0].stages[k]===0));});
test('4663/885两实例高于翻倍，等于与低于均+1及封顶',()=>{for(const x of pick(885))for(const hp of [8999,9000,9001]){const s=make(x,{hp:9000,targetHp:hp});turn(s);assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>s.fighters[0].stages[k]===(hp<9000?2:1)));const cap=make(x);for(const k of H.keys)cap.fighters[0].stages[k]=6;turn(cap);assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>cap.fighters[0].stages[k]===6));}});
test('4663/1046两实例无异常附加最大1/3百分伤，异常不附加，免百分保留红伤',()=>{for(const x of pick(1046)){const s=turn(make(x));assert.equal(sum(s,'percent'),3000);assert.ok(sum(s)>0);const no=make(x);no.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;turn(no);assert.equal(sum(no,'percent'),0);const immune=make(x);timer(immune,1,'固定百分比免疫');turn(immune);assert.equal(sum(immune,'percent'),0);assert.ok(sum(immune)>0);}});
test('4663/1248三实例须已有异常才按70或100施焚烬，免异阻断',()=>{for(const x of pick(1248)){const no=turn(make(x));assert.equal(no.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬'],undefined);let ok=false,fail=false;for(let seed=0;seed<30;seed++){const s=make(x,{seed});s.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;turn(s);if(s.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬'])ok=true;else fail=true;}assert.ok(ok);assert.equal(fail,x.params[0]<100);const immune=make(x);immune.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;timer(immune,1,'免异常');turn(immune);assert.equal(immune.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬'],undefined);}});
test('4663/1604真实全PP恢复2包括当前用招已消耗，满PP与零PP其他槽',()=>{const s=make(e(1604));for(const k of s.fighters[0].moves)s.fighters[0].pp[k]=k===key(37473)?1:0;turn(s);for(const k of s.fighters[0].moves)assert.equal(s.fighters[0].pp[k],2);const full=turn(make(e(1604)));for(const k of full.fighters[0].moves)assert.equal(full.fighters[0].pp[k],full.moveDefinitions[k].pp);});
test('4663/1009真实消正阶后全弱1，无正阶不弱与免弱仍清正',()=>{const s=make(e(1009));s.fighters[1].stages.atk=2;turn(s);assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>s.fighters[1].stages[k]===-1));const no=turn(make(e(1009)));assert.ok(H.keys.every(k=>no.fighters[1].stages[k]===0));const im=make(e(1009));im.fighters[1].stages.atk=2;timer(im,1,'免弱');turn(im);assert.equal(im.fighters[1].stages.atk,0);});
test('4663/1392实际解弱成功才清回合，无负阶不清与免断保留',()=>{const s=make(e(1392));s.fighters[0].stages.atk=-2;timer(s,1,'免异常');turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.atk,0);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].effects['免异常'],undefined);const no=make(e(1392));timer(no,1,'免异常');turn(no);assert.ok(no.fighters[1].effects['免异常']);const im=make(e(1392));im.fighters[0].stages.atk=-2;timer(im,1,'免异常');timer(im,1,'protect');turn(im);assert.equal(im.fighters[0].stages.atk,0);assert.ok(im.fighters[1].effects['免异常']);});
test('4663/44真实特殊红减半五回合，物理不减及到期复原',()=>{const s=make(e(44));enemyMove(s,10007);turn(s,20456,10007);const dmg=s.fighters[0].stats.maxHp-s.fighters[0].hp;const base=make(e(44),{omit:true});enemyMove(base,10007);turn(base,20456,10007);assert.ok(dmg>0&&dmg<=((9000-base.fighters[0].hp)/2)+1);const phy=make(e(44));turn(phy,20456,10001);const raw=make(e(44),{omit:true});turn(raw,20456,10001);assert.equal(phy.fighters[0].hp,raw.fighters[0].hp);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].effects['分类攻击减伤'].end,5);s.round=6;turn(s,10001,10007);assert.equal((s.damageEvents??[]).filter(x=>x.round===6&&x.type==='attack'&&x.targetSide===0)[0].settledDamage,(base.damageEvents??[]).filter(x=>x.type==='attack'&&x.targetSide===0)[0].settledDamage);});
test('4663/48真实免异常三回合，禁止烧伤后到期可施加',()=>{const s=turn(make(e(48)));assert.equal(s.fighters[0].effects['免异常'].end,3);qualified(s,c=>assert.equal(c.ailment(c.a,'烧伤',c.t),false),10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].ailments['烧伤'],undefined);s.round=4;qualified(s,c=>assert.equal(c.ailment(c.a,'烧伤',c.t),true),10001);assert.ok(s.fighters[0].ailments['烧伤']>=4);});
test('4663/47四回合免弱阻断实际等级，到期弱化成功',()=>{const s=turn(make(e(47)));assert.equal(s.fighters[0].effects['免弱'].end,4);qualified(s,c=>c.stage(c.a,-2,['def']),10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.def,0);s.round=5;qualified(s,c=>c.stage(c.a,-2,['def']),10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.def,-2);});
test('4663/191四回合免异反弹，真实两方异常与到期恢复',()=>{const s=turn(make(e(191)));assert.equal(s.fighters[0].effects.reflect.end,4);qualified(s,c=>c.ailment(c.a,'烧伤',c.t),10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].ailments['烧伤'],undefined);assert.ok(s.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']);s.round=5;qualified(s,c=>c.ailment(c.a,'冻伤',c.t),10001);assert.ok(s.fighters[0].ailments['冻伤']>=5);});
test('4663/570两实例免下次攻击真实消费和再次攻击掉HP，未消费重授保护',()=>{for(const x of pick(570)){const s=make(x);turn(s,x.moveId,10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].hp,9000);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].counts.attackNullify,0);turn(s,10001,10001);assert.ok(s.fighters[0].hp<9000);const repeat=turn(make(x));assert.equal(repeat.fighters[0].counts.attackNullify,1);assert.throws(()=>turn(repeat),/Q-N50-4511-006/);}});
test('4663/1200两实例受攻焚烬成功，概率失败和免异未触发消回合',()=>{for(const x of pick(1200)){let success=false,fail=false;for(let seed=0;seed<24;seed++){const s=make(x,{seed});timer(s,1,'test-marker',{n:1});turn(s,x.moveId,10001);assert.ok(s.fighters[0].hp<9000);if(s.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬']){success=true;assert.ok(s.fighters[1].effects['test-marker']);}else{fail=true;assert.equal(s.fighters[1].effects['test-marker'],undefined);}}assert.ok(success);assert.equal(fail,x.params[1]<100);const im=make(x);timer(im,1,'免异常');turn(im,x.moveId,10001);assert.equal(im.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬'],undefined);assert.equal(im.fighters[1].effects['免异常'],undefined);}});
test('4663/1200免攻完整0和实际多段自然保护，不把待确认研究当完成',()=>{for(const x of pick(1200)){const zero=make(x);timer(zero,0,'攻击伤害免疫');assert.throws(()=>turn(zero,x.moveId,10001),/Q-N50-4618-002/);const skip=make(x,{policies:{qualified1200Zero4663:'skip'}});timer(skip,0,'攻击伤害免疫');turn(skip,x.moveId,10001);assert.equal(skip.fighters[0].hp,9000);assert.equal(skip.fighters[1].ailments['焚烬'],undefined);const multi=make(x);enemyMove(multi,10646,0);assert.throws(()=>turn(multi,x.moveId,10646),/Q-A60-4075-012/);}});
test('4663/597两实例首触未知保护，两明确模型真实HP与理论免伤回复禁疗',()=>{for(const x of pick(597)){assert.throws(()=>turn(make(x)),/Q-N50-4625-011/);for(const mode of ['grant-use','next-use']){const s=make(x,{hp:1000,policies:{qualified597First4663:mode}});turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].hp,mode==='grant-use'?4000:1000);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].hp,mode==='grant-use'?6000:9000);turn(s,10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].hp,mode==='grant-use'?7000:4000);}const immune=make(x,{hp:1000,policies:{qualified597First4663:'grant-use'}});timer(immune,1,'固定百分比免疫');turn(immune);assert.equal(immune.fighters[0].hp,4000);assert.equal(immune.fighters[1].hp,9000);const ban=make(x,{hp:1000,policies:{qualified597First4663:'grant-use'}});timer(ban,0,'技能禁疗');turn(ban);assert.equal(ban.fighters[0].hp,1000);assert.equal(ban.fighters[1].hp,6000);}});
test('4663/843两实例下两回合先制2首回合不生效第三轮后到期',()=>{for(const x of pick(843)){const s=turn(make(x));assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,0);turn(s,10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,2);turn(s,10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,2);turn(s,10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,0);}});
test('4663/494仅忽略正防提升，负防削弱保留，对照正防红伤更低',()=>{const a=make(e(494)),b=make(e(494));a.fighters[1].stages.def=6;b.fighters[1].stages.def=-6;turn(a);turn(b);const z=turn(make(e(494)));assert.equal(sum(a),sum(z));assert.ok(sum(b)>sum(z));const raw=make(e(494),{omit:true});raw.fighters[1].stages.def=6;turn(raw);assert.ok(sum(raw)<sum(a));});
test('4663/1956无异常先制额外1，异常不额外并保留原生1',()=>{const s=turn(make(e(1956))),no=make(e(1956));no.fighters[1].ailments['烧伤']=3;turn(no);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,2);assert.equal(no.fighters[0].soulState.resolvedPriority.value,1);});
test('4663/1199吸正成功两轮技能禁疗，实际吸取阶数与不成功不禁',()=>{const s=make(e(1199));s.fighters[1].stages.atk=2;turn(s);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].stages.atk,2);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].stages.atk,0);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].effects['技能禁疗'].end,2);s.fighters[1].hp=1000;qualified(s,c=>c.heal(c.t,300,'明确技能回复','skill'),10001);assert.equal(s.fighters[1].hp,1000-sum(s));const no=turn(make(e(1199)));assert.equal(no.fighters[1].effects['技能禁疗'],undefined);});
